WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.420
The incredible Alex Livinalli.

00:00:01.420 --> 00:00:03.870
[MUSIC] It's
wonderful to see you.

00:00:03.870 --> 00:00:04.830
Exciting, right?

00:00:04.830 --> 00:00:07.470
I mean, she was kind of
she was kind of fangirling

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:08.310
out over you, too.

00:00:08.310 --> 00:00:09.930
We got to say that, right?

00:00:09.930 --> 00:00:12.250
OK, say we're here to your
Marvel fans, because they're--

00:00:12.250 --> 00:00:13.485
We are here!

00:00:13.485 --> 00:00:15.390
[LAUGHING]

00:00:15.390 --> 00:00:18.330
Straight from Ta'lo
and we have Attuma.

00:00:18.330 --> 00:00:20.350
What is it like to be a
part of the Marvel universe?

00:00:20.350 --> 00:00:21.850
- Yeah.
- My God.

00:00:21.850 --> 00:00:22.650
Unreal.

00:00:22.650 --> 00:00:23.450
Yeah.

00:00:23.450 --> 00:00:26.310
This is so unreal,
just being here.

00:00:26.310 --> 00:00:31.860
Finally getting here from
production to everything.

00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:32.970
And now, oh my God.

00:00:32.970 --> 00:00:34.860
Pinch me, pinch me,
please pinch me.

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:35.830
[SHOUTS]

00:00:35.830 --> 00:00:36.630
You're breathing.

00:00:36.630 --> 00:00:37.430
You're awake.

00:00:37.430 --> 00:00:39.400
We know you
can't tell us much,

00:00:39.400 --> 00:00:42.750
but what can you tell
us about your character?

00:00:42.750 --> 00:00:45.750
Such a special project.

00:00:45.750 --> 00:00:47.430
We all work so hard.

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:50.610
And making a movie of this
magnitude, it's no simple joke.

00:00:50.610 --> 00:00:51.600
Not at all.

00:00:51.600 --> 00:00:54.010
You add everything that's
going on in the world.

00:00:54.010 --> 00:00:56.560
The pandemic, it's
even more difficult.

00:00:56.560 --> 00:00:59.460
I am very proud that
we all came together

00:00:59.460 --> 00:01:01.020
and we worked so
hard to make this.

00:01:01.020 --> 00:01:03.900
And I'm excited for
the fans to go see it,

00:01:03.900 --> 00:01:05.700
and then you guys are
going to love this

00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:06.780
because we work so hard for it.

00:01:06.780 --> 00:01:08.310
[LAUGHING]

00:01:08.310 --> 00:01:10.840
OK, you talked about
the process of production.

00:01:10.840 --> 00:01:13.320
But what was it like getting
the call that you are now

00:01:13.320 --> 00:01:14.460
a part of the Marvel universe?

00:01:14.460 --> 00:01:16.548
It was like, I got the
call and I was like--

00:01:16.548 --> 00:01:18.020
[LAUGHING]

00:01:18.020 --> 00:01:18.820
Yeah, that's it.

00:01:18.820 --> 00:01:19.875
That's about all I would do.

00:01:19.875 --> 00:01:20.675
What?

00:01:20.675 --> 00:01:21.510
And then I hung up.

00:01:21.510 --> 00:01:24.960
And then I call my mom.

00:01:24.960 --> 00:01:26.790
Straight to voicemail.

00:01:26.790 --> 00:01:27.820
I call my girlfriend.

00:01:27.820 --> 00:01:28.620
She didn't answer.

00:01:28.620 --> 00:01:29.640
Oh no.

00:01:29.640 --> 00:01:31.450
Then I call my mom, and
she finally answered.

00:01:31.450 --> 00:01:32.250
I told her.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:34.890
And then we were all
excited, and we're here.

00:01:34.890 --> 00:01:36.090
She's somewhere around here.

00:01:36.090 --> 00:01:37.740
And this isn't just any role.

00:01:37.740 --> 00:01:40.560
I mean, you are a
general of Namor's army.

00:01:40.560 --> 00:01:42.630
I can't say that.

00:01:42.630 --> 00:01:43.470
I am Attuma.

00:01:43.470 --> 00:01:44.270
Yes.

00:01:44.270 --> 00:01:48.690
And I am so, so, so excited that
he's finally here in the MCU

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:51.240
and people are going
to meet Attuma.

00:01:51.240 --> 00:01:52.170
Attuma.

00:01:52.170 --> 00:01:54.000
And should we be
afraid of Attuma?

00:01:54.000 --> 00:01:59.100
Listen, he's a very
humble, loving person.

00:01:59.100 --> 00:02:00.960
He loves his people, but
he's someone you don't

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:02.550
want to mess with or piss off.

00:02:02.550 --> 00:02:03.790
Yeah, because he'll tax you.

00:02:03.790 --> 00:02:04.590
Uh-oh.

00:02:04.590 --> 00:02:05.610
Big time.

00:02:05.610 --> 00:02:08.070
More than the IRS.

00:02:08.070 --> 00:02:09.699
I already have real fears.

00:02:09.699 --> 00:02:12.930
I don't need that in my
movies too, my friend.

00:02:12.930 --> 00:02:15.280
Does the hair make an
underwater appearance,

00:02:15.280 --> 00:02:16.080
you know?

00:02:16.080 --> 00:02:19.500
Of course, I want
to make this clear.

00:02:19.500 --> 00:02:23.340
Attuma's hair is real.

00:02:23.340 --> 00:02:25.090
You heard it
here first, folks.

00:02:25.090 --> 00:02:26.803
You heard it here first.

00:02:26.803 --> 00:02:28.270
Well, thank you so much
for talking with us.

00:02:28.270 --> 00:02:29.370
We can't wait to
watch your hair.

00:02:29.370 --> 00:02:30.400
Thank you so much, guys.

00:02:30.400 --> 00:02:31.200
Absolutely.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:32.400
Lovely to speak with you.

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:35.180
(CROSSTALK) Look
forward to seeing you.

